; MBMM Project - 22nm ReRAM SLC 1T1R Configuration
; Baseline: 800MHz (1.25ns per cycle)

; Global Parameters
-CLK 800

; Timing Parameters (Validated SLC)
; Read Latency: 2.07ns -> 2 Cycles
; Write Latency: 10.06ns -> 9 Cycles
-tREAD 2
-tWP 9
-tRCD 2
-tRP 2
-tCAS 2

; Device Parameters
-SensingDelay 5 ; Based on Jain et al. (2019) calibration
-ResistanceLRS 100000 ; 1.0e5 Ohms (Matsui et al. 2025)
-ResistanceHRS 1000000000 ; 1.0e9 Ohms (Matsui et al. 2025)

; Architectural Constraints
-MATHeight 512
-MATWidth 512
-BanksPerRank 8
-AddressMapping RK:BK:CH:R:C